              "formElements": [
                {
                  "config": {
                    "description": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24pt;\"><strong>Emergency Termination Approval</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24pt; color: #236fa1;\"><strong>Step 1 of 1</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>Welcome <span style=\"color: #236fa1;\">{{$.form.input.username}}</span> !!</strong></p>\n<p>One of your direct-reports, <span style=\"color: #236fa1;\">{{$.form.input.requestor}}</span>, has initiated the process to immediately terminate one of their active workers, <span style=\"color: #236fa1;\">{{$.form.input.firstname}} {{$.form.input.lastname}}<span style=\"color: #000000;\">.</span></span></p>\n<p>Corporate policy dictates that such an extreme action requires a 2nd level management approval.  If you need more information or guidance, please review the <a href=\"https://www.sailpoint.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">Emergency Termination Policy</a>.</p>\n<p>You can also reach out for help via Slack in <strong><span style=\"color: #236fa1;\">#help-emergency-termination</span></strong>.</p>",
